WEBVTT

00:15:27.875 --> 00:15:30.851
to cradle the dead to rest.

00:15:30.875 --> 00:15:33.393
It's called "If I could sing."

00:15:33.417 --> 00:15:35.434
If I could sing,

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:39.059
I would not sing
of the fallen city of Ilias

00:15:39.083 --> 00:15:40.768
and glories gone

00:15:40.792 --> 00:15:45.101
or Hector's blood
dried and stained in sand.

00:15:45.125 --> 00:15:46.393
No.

00:15:46.417 --> 00:15:48.643
I would sing of an island,

00:15:48.667 --> 00:15:50.434
far out to the west,

00:15:50.458 --> 00:15:55.518
rising sea-plucked, spray-lashed,
a citadel of stone,

00:15:55.542 --> 00:15:59.059
walled deep in the blue ocean.

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:02.268
Another Troy, an Irish Troy.